  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>About our brand and products:</span></strong><span> <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> </span></span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">SAHC Home Fragrances is not your average candle brand. We create performance-driven luxury fragrances — candles, reed diffusers, wax melts, and room sprays — engineered to fill your entire space with complex, unforgettable scent. Our 10 oz Signature Collection candles are built to perform, with a hot throw powerful enough to travel from room to room and floor to floor. We're the brand that stops people in their tracks and has them asking </span><em style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>\"What IS that? It smells amazing.\"</span></em><span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> — That's SAHC.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span> What makes us different:</span></strong><span> </span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span> SAHC candles are performance candles unlike anything on the market. Our 10 oz Signature Collection delivers a scent throw so powerful it permeates from the first floor to the second — and our customers say it best: </span><em><span>\"What is that?\" \"Damn, that smells good.\" \"This candle lit up my whole downstairs.\"</span></em></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We don't compete on price — we compete on experience. Our complex, luxurious fragrance blends and premium wax formula produce a hot throw that stands next to any major retailer. Packaged in a signature black box with gold foil appointments, every SAHC candle is an elevated sensory experience from the moment it arrives.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Candles start at $30 and reflect the luxury they deliver. We ship worldwide, with free shipping on US orders over $50.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>How affiliates can earn:</span></strong><span> </span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Earn 10% commission on every referred sale. Commissions are tracked automatically via your unique referral link and paid out consistently. The more you share, the more you earn — with no cap on earnings.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>How to promote us:</span></strong><span> </span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Share your unique link on Instagram, Pinterest, TikTok, YouTube, or your blog. We offer stunning product imagery and lifestyle assets that make content creation effortless and on-brand.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>Other information:</span></strong><span> </span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We ship across the US with free shipping on orders over $50. Our growing product line means fresh content opportunities year-round — especially around gifting seasons like Mother's Day, holidays, and Valentine's Day.</span></p></div></div>",
