  "term_and_condition": "<div><div><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Welcome to SAHC Home Fragrances!</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;Thanks for joining our Brand Ambassador Program.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">These following terms and conditions apply to individuals who are accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (\"we\" or \"merchant\") and a Brand Ambassador (\"you\" or \"Ambassador\") who refers customers to use products or services from the merchant.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">By participating in the Program, Ambassador agrees to use the Program in the manner specified in, and are bound by, these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms and Conditions in their entirety you are not authorized to register as a Brand Ambassador or participate in the Program in any manner.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">1. Approve or Reject of the Registration</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;We reserve the right to approve or reject ANY Brand Ambassador Program Registration in our sole and absolute discretion. You will have no legal recourse against us for the rejection of your Brand Ambassador Program Registration.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">2. Ambassador Links and Coupon</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;Your ambassador link is automatically generated, but you can also generate a link for a specific product or collection. If a person clicks on someone else's referral link and then later clicks on yours, yours is the one that counts.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">An Ambassador might or might not be assigned a coupon code with details and usage clarified on the Dashboard. If a customer both clicks on the ambassador link and uses a coupon code, you will not receive a double commission. If you're not assigned a branded coupon, you are not allowed to promote one.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Ambassadors may also advertise the SAHC Home Fragrances website on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and others, or offline channels such as classified ads, magazines, and newspapers.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">3. Commissions and Payment</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;Refer any customer to make a purchase on our website and you will earn a commission calculated based on our Commission structure. Commission amount is dependent on order value and does not include extra fees (tax, shipping cost, etc.).</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">To receive a commission, you must specify your payment details in Settings. Payment schedule will be communicated on the Ambassador Guide page.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Payments will only be sent for transactions that have been successfully completed. Use of the Brand Ambassador Program is subject to a fair use policy which gives the merchant the right to review each and every referral order. Commission status is displayed in the Commission tab; any paid commission will be listed in the Payment tab. Transactions that result in chargebacks or refunds will not be paid out.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">4. Marketing Tools</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;We may share promotional media such as banners, logos, or specific collection promotions through the Marketing Tools tab. You can download the media or get the HTML embed code to share on your ambassador channels.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">5. Network</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;If the Network tab is activated, Ambassadors can invite others to become their downline Ambassador. If any downline Ambassador brings an order to the SAHC store, the upline Ambassador will also earn a network commission depending on merchant settings.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">To invite other Ambassadors, share your network link — anyone who clicks that link and signs up will become your downline Ambassador.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">6. Cookie Tracking</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;We use cookies to track customers who have clicked on your link. Customers must have cookies enabled for us to track their activity.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">If a customer does not allow cookies or clears their cookies, we are unable to track them and cannot pay earnings on that activity.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The cookie duration is displayed on the Ambassador registration form. Tracking begins from the time a customer clicks your ambassador link or uses your coupon code. Within the cookie window, every order made by that customer at the SAHC website will automatically result in a commission — no need for the customer to click your link again.</span></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">7. Removal from the Brand Ambassador Program</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&nbsp;If an Ambassador wishes to be removed from the Brand Ambassador Program, they may do so by contacting:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">brandambassador@getasahc.com</span></strong></p><hr class=\"_hr_13sb5_138\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1.11111px medium medium; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) currentcolor currentcolor; border-image: initial; margin: 24px 0px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;San Francisco&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Go forward and refer!</span></strong></p><p class=\"_p_13sb5_107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 6px 0px; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system